            "notes": "# \u26a0\ufe0f PICK [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) AND [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) NOW!!\n*Read round 5 and 6 tips to understand why.*\n\n## TIP\nI recommend you to use [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).\nWhy? Because this item give you a very good sustain and avoid you to be one shot in most cases. Also, it **cancels the damage taken during the 3s when you use a suzu on yourself or when you tp. So you have an overhall very good damage reduction.\n\n## POWER\n- [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) \n\n------\n## CORE\n- [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)",
